                dp[i][j] = dp[i-1][j-1]
    return dp[m][n]
`

**Complexity:** $O(mn)$ time and space where $m = |s|$, $n = |p|$. The key recurrence for '*' is that it either matches zero characters (look left) or one more character (look up).

